1
00:00:06,799 --> 00:00:07,599
Song Lin!

2
00:00:08,839 --> 00:00:09,720
Ms. Song Lin.

3
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:12,800
I don't know what you're talking about.

4
00:00:14,039 --> 00:00:15,000
Lin,

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,120
this is a misunderstanding.

6
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,239
There's nothing between Yu Song and me.

7
00:00:17,239 --> 00:00:18,039
Get lost!

8
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:19,120
Song Lin,

9
00:00:19,519 --> 00:00:20,519
what do you think you're doing?

10
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:23,760
Dad.

11
00:00:38,679 --> 00:00:39,920
Sorry, everyone.

12
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,280
That's all for today's

13
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,240
press conference.

14
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:44,039
Jing.

15
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:46,479
Handle it.

16
00:00:46,479 --> 00:00:46,780
Okay.

17
00:00:55,799 --> 00:00:56,600
Ms. Zhang,

18
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,200
that was just a misunderstanding.

19
00:00:58,359 --> 00:01:00,399
I heard nothing today but the interview

20
00:01:00,399 --> 00:01:01,560
with Ms. Song Cheng.

21
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:06,626
=Dear Song=

22
00:01:06,666 --> 00:01:08,360
=Episode 10=
(The Comeback)

23
00:01:11,920 --> 00:01:12,840
You two.

24
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,439
Explain.

25
00:01:15,079 --> 00:01:15,760
It's...

26
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,519
It's just the camera angle.

27
00:01:17,799 --> 00:01:18,319
Lin,

28
00:01:18,879 --> 00:01:20,599
you know how much I love you.

29
00:01:20,879 --> 00:01:22,239
Sure, there are women
throwing themselves at me,

30
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:25,680
but I've never done anything
to betray you.

31
00:01:26,599 --> 00:01:28,280
Throwing themselves at you?

32
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:30,040
Who do you think you are?

33
00:01:33,799 --> 00:01:34,599
Let me tell you,

34
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:38,040
you're nothing but a lapdog
I keep around.

35
00:01:38,719 --> 00:01:41,000
Those women think
they've landed a big catch,

36
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:43,640
but really they're just clinging to
my lackey!

37
00:01:43,719 --> 00:01:44,519
Enough!

38
00:01:45,239 --> 00:01:46,599
Isn't this embarrassing enough?

39
00:01:47,719 --> 00:01:48,319
Yu Song,

40
00:01:49,239 --> 00:01:50,400
how do you explain this?

41
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:54,799
That day I went out to pick up wood
for Ms. Song Cheng,

42
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:56,400
and I ran into Mr. Zhao.

43
00:01:56,799 --> 00:01:58,599
Mr. Zhao wanted me to help him test

44
00:01:58,599 --> 00:02:00,280
a perfume he bought for Ms. Song Lin.

45
00:02:00,599 --> 00:02:01,519
That's all.

46
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,040
It's just the camera angle.

47
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:04,640
If we were really involved,

48
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:07,000
what was the person
who took the photos up to?

49
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,520
I think we should investigate her first.

50
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,280
Dad,

51
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:16,919
Lin,

52
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:18,840
it's exactly like Yu Song said.

53
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:21,479
How could I possibly do anything
to betray the Song family?

54
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:22,599
Dad,

55
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,639
Yu Song has been by my side for so long.

56
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:26,199
I know exactly
what kind of person she is.

57
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,520
I trust her.

58
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,800
Trust her?

59
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:32,400
Everyone's seen what she's capable of.

60
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:35,400
She came to be an assistant
for a cripple like you.

61
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:36,800
What's in it for her?

62
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:38,520
Song Cheng,

63
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:40,400
don't let yourself

64
00:02:40,639 --> 00:02:44,080
become someone else's stepping stone.

65
00:02:46,719 --> 00:02:47,360
Yu Song,

66
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:49,800
whether you did it or not,

67
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,479
there's no way

68
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,199
to clear this up.

69
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,280
I'm afraid you'll have to
leave the Song household.

70
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,319
(Yu Song,)

71
00:03:43,919 --> 00:03:44,919
(you're fired!)

72
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:48,800
Honey,

73
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,000
I was wrong.

74
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:51,960
But I was only using Yu Song.

75
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:54,360
I wanted her to get info
on the hot spring project

76
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,840
out of Song Huan.

77
00:03:56,360 --> 00:03:57,039
It was

78
00:03:57,039 --> 00:03:58,879
purely a business deal between us.

79
00:03:59,159 --> 00:03:59,599
Honey,

80
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:01,639
you're the only one I love.

81
00:04:02,039 --> 00:04:03,439
I don't want to see

82
00:04:03,439 --> 00:04:05,199
Song Huan walk all over you anymore.

83
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,759
Then why didn't you say so earlier?

84
00:04:07,159 --> 00:04:07,960
I...

85
00:04:08,759 --> 00:04:10,479
I know you don't like Yu Song.

86
00:04:11,199 --> 00:04:12,199
I was afraid you'd get mad.

87
00:04:14,479 --> 00:04:15,599
Remember,

88
00:04:16,199 --> 00:04:18,680
I didn't throw you out of this family
along with her today

89
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:21,360
because I still have
a little thing for you.

90
00:04:25,439 --> 00:04:28,399
If my money goes down the drain,

91
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:31,240
you know what'll happen.

92
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,160
Song.

93
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,839
I'm going to see Song Huaishan right now

94
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:46,199
and tell him about us.

95
00:04:46,439 --> 00:04:47,759
That way he won't suspect you.

96
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:48,800
No.

97
00:04:49,759 --> 00:04:51,560
If he finds out about us,

98
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,199
he'll suspect you too.

99
00:04:53,439 --> 00:04:54,399
He might even figure out

100
00:04:54,399 --> 00:04:57,000
we plotted to get me into
the Song household.

101
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,560
That won't help me.

102
00:04:58,560 --> 00:04:59,759
It'll just drag you down with me.

103
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:01,439
Then let's leave together?

104
00:05:01,959 --> 00:05:03,600
I have to go back to the Song household.

105
00:05:05,839 --> 00:05:06,639
Song,

106
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:09,639
what is it about the Song family
that's so special to you?

107
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,600
Why are you so hung up on them?

108
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:14,360
So

109
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,519
how are you getting back in?

110
00:05:21,439 --> 00:05:22,079
I'll wait.

111
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,639
They will ask me to come back.

112
00:05:35,079 --> 00:05:36,079
(Trust her?)

113
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,800
(Everyone's seen what she's capable of.)

114
00:05:39,079 --> 00:05:41,600
(She came to be an assistant
for a cripple like you.)

115
00:05:41,600 --> 00:05:42,560
(What's in it for her?)

116
00:05:43,279 --> 00:05:44,079
(Song Cheng,)

117
00:05:44,600 --> 00:05:46,199
(don't let yourself)

118
00:05:46,360 --> 00:05:49,800
(become someone else's stepping stone.)

119
00:05:49,879 --> 00:05:50,680
(Yu Song.)

120
00:05:51,319 --> 00:05:54,120
(Did you really want to help me today,)

121
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,959
(or were you just using me)

122
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,759
(to work for Huan?)

123
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:02,319
Ugh,

124
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,879
that girl.

125
00:06:04,959 --> 00:06:06,319
From the first day she set foot here,

126
00:06:06,319 --> 00:06:08,600
I knew she was bad news.

127
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,120
Seriously.

128
00:06:10,399 --> 00:06:11,480
So,

129
00:06:11,879 --> 00:06:12,800
Ms. Song Cheng,

130
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,560
I think

131
00:06:15,279 --> 00:06:16,680
you should be happy.

132
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:20,000
A sticky-fingered girl like her?

133
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:21,800
Good riddance.

134
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:23,199
Don't worry.

135
00:06:23,199 --> 00:06:24,600
As for your new assistant,

136
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:26,120
I've already found someone for you.

137
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,680
Who on earth

138
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:31,680
left these ratty gloves here?

139
00:06:31,879 --> 00:06:32,879
Ms. Song Cheng,

140
00:06:32,879 --> 00:06:33,920
I'm throwing these out.

141
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:36,279
You've got way too much junk
lying around.

142
00:06:38,399 --> 00:06:40,079
What is all this

143
00:06:40,079 --> 00:06:40,879
junk?

144
00:06:43,079 --> 00:06:44,480
Pick up the gloves.

145
00:06:47,399 --> 00:06:48,600
Pick them up!

146
00:06:51,399 --> 00:06:52,199
Wait...

147
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:53,839
Just a pair of ratty gloves.

148
00:06:55,959 --> 00:06:57,800
What do you even want them for?

149
00:07:10,519 --> 00:07:12,560
(These are the new gloves Dad gave me.)

150
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:14,759
(He probably got the size wrong.)

151
00:07:15,199 --> 00:07:16,279
(It's okay, Yu Song.)

152
00:07:22,319 --> 00:07:24,439
Ms. Song Cheng, why are you crying?

153
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:26,480
If anyone sees this,

154
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:29,079
they'll think... I did something to you.

155
00:07:29,079 --> 00:07:30,000
Dad.

156
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:34,000
I want to see Dad!

157
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:43,120
She really knows what she's doing.

158
00:07:44,079 --> 00:07:44,839
Dad,

159
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:45,879
Yu Song has been with me

160
00:07:45,879 --> 00:07:46,879
every day all this time.

161
00:07:46,879 --> 00:07:48,040
Say no more.

162
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,480
She's not coming back.

163
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:51,680
Why?

164
00:07:53,399 --> 00:07:54,199
No.

165
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:55,959
Dad,

166
00:07:56,319 --> 00:07:58,120
ever since my accident,

167
00:07:58,120 --> 00:08:00,079
I haven't asked for anything.

168
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:01,800
I know I'm just a cripple

169
00:08:01,959 --> 00:08:03,800
and I'm useless to our family.

170
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,160
But

171
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,879
I just want Yu Song back.

172
00:08:08,399 --> 00:08:09,240
I'm sure

173
00:08:09,240 --> 00:08:11,079
she didn't do anything like that...

174
00:08:11,079 --> 00:08:12,079
Enough.

175
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,519
Whether she did it or not,

176
00:08:14,079 --> 00:08:14,560
if word gets out,

177
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:16,480
it's bad for the Song family.

178
00:08:16,879 --> 00:08:18,399
You should focus

179
00:08:18,399 --> 00:08:20,000
on the partnership with Mr. Yu.

180
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,279
I'll have Ms. Chen

181
00:08:21,279 --> 00:08:23,279
get you
a new personal assistant tomorrow.

182
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,660
(Incoming voice call from Zhao Hui)

183
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:47,480
Song,

184
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,120
are you really sure about this?

185
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:51,080
It's almost eleven.

186
00:08:51,519 --> 00:08:52,759
Once Song Huaishan makes a decision,

187
00:08:52,759 --> 00:08:54,120
it's set in stone by morning.

188
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:56,360
We can't count on Song Cheng anymore.

189
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,159
You know what?

190
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:01,720
When fishermen go out to sea,

191
00:09:01,919 --> 00:09:03,360
the last thing they should do

192
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,799
is rush to pull in the net.

193
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:07,080
Sometimes the big fish gets caught

194
00:09:07,279 --> 00:09:08,840
at the very last second.

195
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:10,960
Rush it, and you miss it.

196
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:13,279
The money I've made off the Songs

197
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:15,879
could buy the priciest bottle of liquor
in Nigang.

198
00:09:16,960 --> 00:09:17,559
But do you know

199
00:09:17,559 --> 00:09:19,399
why I still like

200
00:09:19,399 --> 00:09:21,200
cheap soda?

201
00:09:31,279 --> 00:09:32,759
Because the way

202
00:09:33,559 --> 00:09:35,679
the bubbles pop in your mouth

203
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:36,879
feels just like

204
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:40,480
a big fish fighting for its life
when you pull in the net.

205
00:09:42,279 --> 00:09:43,559
Nothing's decided

206
00:09:44,159 --> 00:09:45,279
until the very end.

207
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,639
Just like

208
00:09:47,639 --> 00:09:49,559
when I thought I was going to drown,

209
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,080
and then I met you.

210
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:11,879
So you've got
other cards up your sleeve?

211
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,440
Song Cheng

212
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:16,360
was never my only card.

213
00:10:28,679 --> 00:10:29,879
What are you doing here?

214
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:51,940
(WeChat voice call from Ms. Chen)

215
00:10:59,399 --> 00:11:00,240
(Yu Song,)

216
00:11:00,559 --> 00:11:02,360
(Mr. Song's feeling generous.)

217
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:04,399
(Just come back to work tomorrow.)

218
00:11:04,559 --> 00:11:05,600
(Don't be late.)

219
00:11:08,879 --> 00:11:09,879
So tell me,

220
00:11:10,279 --> 00:11:11,519
how did you turn this around?

221
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:13,440
Hmm...

222
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:17,679
Song Cheng's soft heart

223
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:21,759
and Song Huan's value.

224
00:11:22,559 --> 00:11:23,399
So you've got them both

225
00:11:23,399 --> 00:11:24,679
completely wrapped around your finger.

226
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:31,860
(Song Cheng)

227
00:11:32,480 --> 00:11:33,480
Song Cheng...

228
00:11:35,080 --> 00:11:36,559
is different from the rest of the Songs.

229
00:11:36,690 --> 00:11:39,800
(Song Cheng)
